OL,3,GNEWSARolls-Royce incident prompts
OL,4,Aemergency response
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmergency services are responding to an
OL,7,Fincident at a Rolls-Royce factory in
OL,8,FDerby.
OL,10,FDerbyshire Fire Service said it was
OL,11,Fcalled to the site in Raynesway shortly
OL,12,Fafter 16:00 GMT on Thursday.
OL,14,FThey have been joined at the scene by
OL,15,Fpolice and ambulance colleagues, who
OL,16,Fhave been seen outside the factory.
OL,18,FFirefighters have advised people in the
OL,19,FAlvaston area of Derby to keep their
OL,20,Fwindows and doors closed while
OL,21,Femergency services deal with the
OL,22,Fincident.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
